============================================================================================
DRIVE taper — BLEED-FREE shape measurement (session 16 step 1)
============================================================================================
Premise: only DriveStage is drive-dependent => Y(f,x) = C(f) + M(f)*g(x), g real.
The clean BLEND bleed lives entirely in C and CANCELS. Anchors g(0)=1/104.3k, g(1)=1/4.3k
are taper-SHAPE-independent circuit facts. Two estimators: (A) complex affine,
(B) magnitude-only 3-freq joint (alignment-immune). Self-tested on model renders first.

