  drive   min (x=0.00)  cap lag   +0.037 smp   mdl lag  +64.082 smp   cap fund-SNR min  87.7 dB
  drive  9:30 (x=0.25)  cap lag   +0.097 smp   mdl lag  +64.135 smp   cap fund-SNR min  88.5 dB
  drive  noon (x=0.50)  cap lag   +2.522 smp   mdl lag  +67.322 smp   cap fund-SNR min  88.7 dB
  drive  2:30 (x=0.75)  cap lag   +2.527 smp   mdl lag  +67.517 smp   cap fund-SNR min  89.0 dB
  drive   max (x=1.00)  cap lag   +2.421 smp   mdl lag  +67.555 smp   cap fund-SNR min  88.6 dB
  (SNR = fundamental vs LS residual. Low SNR at the quietest rungs would show here.)

