  worst error vs truth:  (A)  0.00%   (B)  0.00%      [(A) rms 1.15e-06, (B) rms 1.74e-07]
  (A) recovered per-take delays (smp, take0=0 by construction): +0.00 -0.05 -3.24 -3.44 -3.47
  The 'naive' columns are the SAME data with per-take delay NOT modelled: exact at
