--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  (A) recovered per-take delays (smp): +0.00 -0.06 -2.95 -3.68 -3.82   [fit rms 2.78e-03]
  (B) magnitude-only joint fit rms 4.91e-04

  Per-level stability (estimator B re-solved at each rung — a clipper-grazed rung would
